{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/修改建议", "char_count": 435, "heading_path": "修改建议", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "修改建议", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 3, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdOb61lT", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "67875346a75bd2f81a40b387652d6824faefe083f61c025c5801034ab6d4074e", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 删除 pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/无痛/缓解疼痛等疼痛功效承诺（含 sans douleur/schmerzfrei/sin dolor），只保留 comfort/gentle 与缓解胀满不适 discomfort 的表述 ▸ 删除自动识别节奏/模拟复制宝宝/饱腹反馈/降低奶量焦虑等智能闭环与仿生宣称；仿生表达只允许 inspired by natural nursing（参考自然哺乳节奏的设计思路）", "unit_id": "0d3289c8b0363292fff1", "unit_type": "entry"}
{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdOb61lT/命中原因", "char_count": 299, "heading_path": "命中原因", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "命中原因", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 4, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdOb61lT", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "67875346a75bd2f81a40b387652d6824faefe083f61c025c5801034ab6d4074e", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H07 疼痛功效承诺（pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/缓解疼痛等；吸奶疼痛因人而异，只可讲 comfort/gentle 舒适与缓解胀满不适 discomfort）；H09 智能闭环/仿生虚假宣称（自动识别节奏、模拟/复制宝宝、饱腹反馈、降低奶量焦虑）；W1当前为用户主动调节+保存程序，非闭环生理识别", "unit_id": "cb3ae64719ed621f4e63", "unit_type": "entry"}
