{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObLAH7/修改建议", "char_count": 370, "heading_path": "修改建议", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "修改建议", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 3, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObLAH7", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "c6ced97dc6a4a5d083e2313359b5eda67f0197b1b34eab299667c7cc7048fb3f", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除 ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest", "unit_id": "0e4f822e5938e9b930ef", "unit_type": "entry"}
