{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObP1co/修改建议", "char_count": 344, "heading_path": "修改建议", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "修改建议", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 3, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObP1co", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "07af2d3f9e18e457fc89ddc09cec9608d6aa37f1dff8caae68472ac9e7711fbe", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "删除 pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/无痛/缓解疼痛等疼痛功效承诺（含 sans douleur/schmerzfrei/sin dolor），只保留 comfort/gentle 与缓解胀满不适 discomfort 的表述 ▸ 删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用", "unit_id": "cc26fc89813087a7fce8", "unit_type": "entry"}
