{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObUDHi/修改建议", "char_count": 407, "heading_path": "修改建议", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "修改建议", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 3, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObUDHi", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "fe91394606beb490dfd6ac18b04f6efeae7eb78ebedc95197e0d232c9dc39a39", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 删除 pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/无痛/缓解疼痛等疼痛功效承诺（含 sans douleur/schmerzfrei/sin dolor），只保留 comfort/gentle 与缓解胀满不适 discomfort 的表述 ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化", "unit_id": "718b97a8006ac45ecc62", "unit_type": "entry"}
{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObUDHi/命中原因", "char_count": 270, "heading_path": "命中原因", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "命中原因", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 4, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObUDHi", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "fe91394606beb490dfd6ac18b04f6efeae7eb78ebedc95197e0d232c9dc39a39", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H07 疼痛功效承诺（pain-free/no pain/without pain/pain relief/less pain/缓解疼痛等；吸奶疼痛因人而异，只可讲 comfort/gentle 舒适与缓解胀满不适 discomfort）；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）", "unit_id": "33652f5e43ee45fd7145", "unit_type": "entry"}
