{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/修改建议", "char_count": 433, "heading_path": "修改建议", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "修改建议", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 3, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObWZ2t", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "351f2c9d403a1e1c6e014c051ab32f0f641b0b5db22862b0fd906fefda23d240", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 效果百分比/销量/评分声称需附测试来源与口径，否则删除（折扣百分比不在此列） ▸ 静音表述改客观参数（as low as 48 dB），避免 whisper/silent/ultra-quiet 绝对化 ▸ hospital/NICU 场景表述需事实依据，否则删除 ▸ 吸力表述改客观参数（up to -300 mmHg、15 adjustable levels），删除 maximum/strongest ▸ hospital/medical grade 需认证依据，否则删除", "unit_id": "52ea2f1459692f2065bb", "unit_type": "entry"}
{"anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObWZ2t/命中原因", "char_count": 241, "heading_path": "命中原因", "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"field_name": "命中原因", "kind": "field_value"}, "order_in_parent": 4, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "bitable__Lk3Qb8y2QaVyZns6gprcVNE9nA0__recvuJYdObWZ2t", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "351f2c9d403a1e1c6e014c051ab32f0f641b0b5db22862b0fd906fefda23d240", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；M03 未标注来源的效果数据声明；M01 静音程度夸大（建议改为 low noise / quiet mode）；U03 涉及医院/NICU 场景，需核实临床适用性声明；M02 吸力夸大用语（建议改为客观档位描述）；M05 等级背书用语（需核实是否有对应认证）", "unit_id": "01e6bd468e30cbf95677", "unit_type": "entry"}
