esting that the product alone (such as without diet, exercise, or a calorie-controlled diet) can be used to achieve results or that a weight loss product is effective for everyone.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Ads for weight management are prohibited from guaranteeing permanent weight loss, a specific rate of weight loss, or promising that weight wonât be regained after stopping the product.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Ads must avoid content that encourages unhealthy eating habits or negative body image and are prohibited from using before and after imagery.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Claims that non-prescription products are as effective as prescription products.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Regulatory endorsement claims on healthcare products.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Any book that includes claims to cure a high-risk disease or ailment.</span> </li> </ul> <p></p> <dfn class=\"anchor-restrictcontent\"></dfn> <h2 class=\"otp\">Restricted content</h2> <p>We permit environmental claims, origin claims, warranties or guarantees, and claims that describe health or quality ingredients on ingestible products such as gluten free or organic.", "unit_id": "26ba56cc55774a4f756c", "unit_type": "clause"}
