{"anchor": "#l.1-1", "char_count": 4745, "heading_path": null, "kb_type": "external_standard", "meta": {"anchor_precision": "segment_plus_char_offset", "char_offset_in_source": 38006, "content_quality_flag": "l1_extraction_includes_code", "content_quality_note": "该段来自 L1 的 url_text（extract_method=json_literals），实测以 JS 胶水为主、非政策正文。切分器只按句拆，不改写不丢弃；本单元可用性存疑，已在报告登记为 L1 抽取质量问题（kb/l1 只读，不就地修）", "kind": "paragraph", "source_segment_chars": 107939, "split": "in_line_sentence"}, "order_in_parent": 12, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "url__https____advertising.amazon.com_help_GPSSMTEAA6AEWY3A", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "baa5ebd0250c2e3c9179602aa2838e7de77e077dac9fcc92d6ad9d910edd6704", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "Requirements are defined by product categories as follows (non-exhaustive list).</p> <p> </p> <table class=\"help-table\"> <thead> <tr> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N100C1\"> <p></p> </th> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N100C4\">Product types</th> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N100C8\">Supply-specific restrictions</th> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N100CC\">Targeting restrictions*</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td align=\"left\"><strong>Category 1 (low sensitivity products): Generally allowed</strong></td> <td align=\"left\">Allergy and Sinus, Splints and Supports, Breast Pump, Cough and Cold, COVID Test Kits, Digestion, Eczema, Eye health, Foot Remedies, General Stress, General Wellness Health Tests or Monitors, Menopause, Menstruation Products, Physical Therapy Aids, Pain Relievers, Rosacea, Sleep or snoring Aids, and others.</td> <td align=\"left\">Permitted on all supply with the following restrictions: <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span> must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> </td> <td align=\"left\"> <p></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"left\"><strong>Category 2 (medium sensitivity products): Allowed with restrictions</strong></td> <td align=\"left\">Denture care, head lice treatments, Hearing, Mobility and Visual Aids, Psoriasis, Smoking Cessation, Weight Loss, and others.</td> <td align=\"left\"> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Fire TV</span>, <span>Fire tablet</span>, <span>Alexa</span>, <span>Amazon store homepage</span>: prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Twitch</span> and <span>IMDb</span>: homepage prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> </td> <td align=\"left\"> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Audience creation related to purchase/views of these products is prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Use of Advertiser Audiences - audiences built from advertiser data via AMC or direct DSP upload - is prohibited</span> </li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"left\"><strong>Category 3 (high sensitivity products): Allowed with additional restrictions</strong></td> <td align=\"left\">Adult Incontinence, Alcohol tests, Anxiety Support, Breathing Trainers and Monitors, Breathalyzers, Condoms, Diabetes Support, Erectile Dysfunction Medication, Family Planning and Reproductive Health, Fat Burners, Metabolism Boosters, Appetite Suppressants, and GLP-1 Supplements, Hangover Support, Intimate Care Products, Lubricants, Naloxone Nasal Spray, Skin Tag and Wart Removers, Speech and Communication Aids, testosterone or libido boosters, and others.</td> <td align=\"left\"> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Fire TV</span>, <span>Fire tablet</span>, <span>Alexa</span>, <span>Amazon store homepage</span>: prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon store</span>: contextual placement is required</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Prime Video Display</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, G, and PG/TVPG (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Twitch</span> and <span>IMDb</span>: homepage prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude Children's Music genre and Kids podcasts</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Goodreads: Prohibited</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> </td> <td align=\"left\"> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Audience creation related to purchases or views of these products is prohibited.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Use of Advertiser Audiences - audiences built from advertiser data via AMC or direct DSP upload - is prohibited.</span> </li> </ul> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p></p> <p>*Targeting restrictions apply to all supply types.</p> <dfn class=\"anchor-sexualwellness\"></dfn> <h2 class=\"otp\">Sexual wellness products</h2> <p>Sexual wellness products are category 3 consumer healthcare products that are allowed with additional restrictions.", "unit_id": "293626a152425881f550", "unit_type": "clause"}
