{"anchor": "#l.1-1", "char_count": 44, "heading_path": null, "kb_type": "external_standard", "meta": {"anchor_precision": "segment_plus_char_offset", "char_offset_in_source": 44138, "content_quality_flag": "l1_extraction_includes_code", "content_quality_note": "该段来自 L1 的 url_text（extract_method=json_literals），实测以 JS 胶水为主、非政策正文。切分器只按句拆，不改写不丢弃；本单元可用性存疑，已在报告登记为 L1 抽取质量问题（kb/l1 只读，不就地修）", "kind": "paragraph", "source_segment_chars": 107939, "split": "in_line_sentence"}, "order_in_parent": 17, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "url__https____advertising.amazon.com_help_GPSSMTEAA6AEWY3A", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "baa5ebd0250c2e3c9179602aa2838e7de77e077dac9fcc92d6ad9d910edd6704", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "The use of audience targeting is restricted.", "unit_id": "c4623ac54409840dc15b", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-1", "char_count": 6182, "heading_path": null, "kb_type": "external_standard", "meta": {"anchor_precision": "segment_plus_char_offset", "char_offset_in_source": 44183, "content_quality_flag": "l1_extraction_includes_code", "content_quality_note": "该段来自 L1 的 url_text（extract_method=json_literals），实测以 JS 胶水为主、非政策正文。切分器只按句拆，不改写不丢弃；本单元可用性存疑，已在报告登记为 L1 抽取质量问题（kb/l1 只读，不就地修）", "kind": "paragraph", "source_segment_chars": 107939, "split": "in_line_sentence"}, "order_in_parent": 18, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "url__https____advertising.amazon.com_help_GPSSMTEAA6AEWY3A", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "baa5ebd0250c2e3c9179602aa2838e7de77e077dac9fcc92d6ad9d910edd6704", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "Requirements are defined by medication categories as follows (non-exhaustive list).</p> <p> </p> <table class=\"help-table\"> <thead> <tr> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N1026A\"> <p></p> </th> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N1026D\">Pharmaceutical product category (condition supported)</th> <th align=\"left\" id=\"N10271\">Supply-specific restrictions</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td align=\"left\"><strong>Category 1 (moderate sensitivity): Allowed with restrictions</strong></td> <td align=\"left\">Allergies, Arthritis, Asthma, Blood Pressure, Bronchitis, Cirrhosis, Constipation, Coronary Artery Disease, Crohn's disease, Diabetes, Dupuytrenâs Contracture, Epilepsy, Fibromyalgia, Glaucoma, Hair Loss, Hemorrhoid, Insomnia, Irritable Bowel Disease or Syndrome, Meningitis, Menopause, Metabolic Bone Disease, Migraine/headache, Movement disorders, Overactive Bladder, Pneumonia, Psoriasis, RSV, Sclerosis, Shingles, and Smoking Cessation</td> <td align=\"left\">Permitted on the following placements with restrictions (as shown): <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Fire TV</span>, <span>Fire tablet</span>, <span>Alexa</span>, <span>IMDb</span>, <span>Twitch</span></span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>).</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon store</span>: contextual placement is required</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude kids' music and podcasts</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"left\"><strong>Category 2 (higher sensitivity): Allowed with additional restrictions</strong></td> <td align=\"left\">ADHD, Alzheimer, Anxiety, Bipolar Disorder, Cancer, Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD), Depression, Erectile Dysfunction, Hepatitis, HIV/AIDS, HPV, Parkinson, Peyronieâs Disease, Birth Control, Tuberculosis, and Weight Loss</td> <td align=\"left\"> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Twitch</span>: prohibited on homepage, sponsored streams, and mobile in-feed</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G, PG/TVPG (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude kids' music and podcasts</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p></p> <dfn class=\"anchor-healthcareservices\"></dfn> <h2 class=\"otp\">Healthcare services</h2> <p>Healthcare services may include practitioners, hospitals and institutions, health clinics, online pharmacies, telemedicine services, or other services devoted to wellness or care of health conditions/disease.</p> <p> <strong>Supply-specific restrictions</strong> </p> <p>Healthcare services such as practitioners or hospitals/institutions:</p> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude kids' music and podcasts</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> <p></p> <p>Healthcare services related to mental health, sexual wellness, addiction, cosmetic procedures, weight loss, or end-of-life:</p> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon store</span>: Prohibited </span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude kids' music and podcasts and daypart from 7PM to 6AM.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, G, and PG/TVPG (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Twitch</span> and <span>IMDb</span>: off-homepage</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> <p></p> <p>Online pharmacies and telemedicine: </p> <div class=\"adsinlineMessage-info\"> <p> <strong>Note</strong>: Ads for online pharmacies are accepted only in the US, when registered with the NABP, as well as Sweden and Germany when a EU Common logo is present on the landing page and reflects relevant registration.</p> </div> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon store Display ads</span>: Prohibited </span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon Music Free</span>: must exclude kids' music and podcasts</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Amazon O&amp;O Streaming TV</span>: must exclude content rated NR, TV-Y, TV-Y7, and G (review <a href=\"#G7NP3SWRVV6UV66V?anchor=contentrating\">content rating guidelines</a>)</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\"><span>Open Internet</span>: permitted with accurate category declaration</span> </li> </ul> <p></p> <p> <strong>Targeting (all healthcare services for all supply types)</strong> </p> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Audience creation related to purchase/views of these services is prohibited.</span> </li> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Use of Advertiser Audiences - audiences built from advertiser data via AMC or direct DSP upload - is prohibited.</span> </li> </ul> <p></p> <dfn class=\"anchor-countryrestrict\"></dfn> <h2 class=\"otp\"> <span>Country-specific restrictions</span> </h2> <p>Ads must promote only the products and services that are permitted by the local regulatory authorities for the condition treated in each of the countries where the ads will run.", "unit_id": "529bc02e7093ba827c09", "unit_type": "clause"}
