{"anchor": "#l.1-1", "char_count": 4431, "heading_path": null, "kb_type": "external_standard", "meta": {"anchor_precision": "segment_plus_char_offset", "char_offset_in_source": 50557, "content_quality_flag": "l1_extraction_includes_code", "content_quality_note": "该段来自 L1 的 url_text（extract_method=json_literals），实测以 JS 胶水为主、非政策正文。切分器只按句拆，不改写不丢弃；本单元可用性存疑，已在报告登记为 L1 抽取质量问题（kb/l1 只读，不就地修）", "kind": "paragraph", "source_segment_chars": 107939, "split": "in_line_sentence"}, "order_in_parent": 20, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "url__https____advertising.amazon.com_help_GPSSMTEAA6AEWY3A", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1240", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "baa5ebd0250c2e3c9179602aa2838e7de77e077dac9fcc92d6ad9d910edd6704", "splitter_version": "l2-0.2", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": "20260924-1210", "text": "The below country-specific healthcare requirements apply (a non-exhaustive list):</p> <div class=\"wrapper\"> <dfn class=\"header-adssectionExpander-1\">Bahrain, Jordan, Kuwait, Morocco, Oman, Qatar</dfn> <div class=\"adssectionExpander-1\"> <p>Ads for healthcare products and services are prohibited (for example, medical devices, OTCs, and herbal and dietary supplements).</p> </div> <dfn class=\"header-adssectionExpander-2\">Brazil and New Zealand</dfn> <div class=\"adssectionExpander-2\"> <p>Ads must not include statements by medical professionals that imply professional advice, preferences, or recommendations.</p> </div> <dfn class=\"header-adssectionExpander-3\">Egypt, Kingdom of Saudi Arabia, United Arab Emirates, and Turkey</dfn> <div class=\"adssectionExpander-3\"> <p>Ads for healthcare products and services (for example, medical devices OTCs and herbal and dietary supplements) are restricted.</p> </div> <dfn class=\"header-adssectionExpander-4\">Japan</dfn> <div class=\"adssectionExpander-4\"> <p> </p> <ul class=\"a-vertical\"> <li> <span class=\"a-list-item\">Medical produc