ead Prevention\n极简婴儿头型对比封面，突出“预防扁头”主题，保持品牌高级留白与柔和母婴插画风格。\n02 Common Mistakes｜2 Mistakes To Avoid\n通过错误/正确对比插画，展示睡姿和睡眠辅助用品误区，警示手绘元素告知错误。信息清晰直观。\n03 Switch Head Direction\n展示宝宝睡觉时调整头部方向的方法，用简单动作变化表达预防头部固定受压。\n04 Switch Up The View\n用婴儿床位置变化和视觉方向调整，表现增加宝宝转头机会的护理方式。\n05 Make Time For Tummy Time\n描绘父母陪伴宝宝进行 tummy time，突出清醒监督下的互动练习。\n06 Switch Arms\n通过左右抱娃对比插画，展示喂养和抱持时交替支撑的重要性。\n07 Take Breaks From Baby Gear\n展示减少长时间使用安全座椅等用品，让宝宝获得更多自由活动时间。\n08 Reference Page\n极简文献页面设计，延续品牌编辑感，提升科普内容的专业可信度。\n社媒封面展示：\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_80a276ff-0ca0-45d9-9547-abfdbe447afg)\n扁头&圆头宝宝封面参考：\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_ca798621-05b7-49eb-8603-b4698dbdcc4g)\n\n\n**设计稿件：**\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_6ac4796f-ec46-484c-965f-fc4b20ab353g)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_674459fd-da3d-4692-bcfa-4d6012ee652g)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_7145210e-4532-46e7-a9bc-88fcc0a2aeeg)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_3060b501-6b49-493d-9bfc-2d4ec5ea540g)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_fe745cea-7866-4ff7-af72-ef75d3f88deg)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_228657b0-502a-4de3-bfd2-efb89791bcag)\n![Image](img_v3_0215p_966226dd-a628-4993-8067-c6244cd54d4g)\n\n04 When awake\nSwitch arms\nAlternate arms when feeding and carrying a baby.\nLeft arm, then right — to give each side a break. 12]\nLeft this time\nRight this time\n\nReference\nII/Collazo, Geisel R., and Maria Isabel\nAngulo. \"Flat Head Syndrome in Infants.\"\nJama, vol. 331, no. 17, May 2024, p. 1512,\nhttps://doi.org/10.1001/jama.2023.26048.\n[2]Queensland Health. (2022). *Queensland\nclinical guideline: Safer infant sleep*.\nhttps://www.health.ald.gov.au/_data/assets/\npdf_file/0025/1166353/g-safer-sleep.pdf\n[3]Sargent, B., Coulter, C., Cannoy, J., & Kaplan,\nS. L. (2024). Physical therapy management of\ncongenital muscular torticollis: A 2024\nevidence-based clinical practice guideline\nfrom the American Physical Therapy\nAssociation Academy of Pediatric Physical\nTherapy. Pediatric Physical Therapy, 36(4),\n370-421.\nhttps://doi.org/10.1097/PEP.0000000000001114", "source_sha256": "1aa80b3a0fbf2bea5