n\nAPP\n\nSize Guide\n\nFAQ\n\nShipping & Delivery\n\nReturn & Exchange\n\nCommunity Discount\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nContact Us\n\nBreastfeeding\n\nThe Ultimate Momcozy Breast Pump Comparison: Finding Your Perfect Fit\n\nBy : Momcozy Care Team\n\nLast updated :\nAugust 10, 2026\n\nTable of Contents\n\nHow Many Breast Pump Models Does Momcozy Have?\n\nMomcozy W Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy Air Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy M Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy V Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy S Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy Breast Pump Models Comparison\n\nHow to Choose the Right Momcozy Breast Pump\n\nHow to Clean and Care for Your Momcozy Breast Pump\n\nHow do I troubleshoot common Momcozy breast pump issues?\n\nWhat does Momcozy after-sales support include?\n\nYour Pumping FAQs Answered\n\nConclusion: Your Perfect Pump is Waiting\n\nShow All\n\nFinding the right breast pump shouldn't be complicated. At Momcozy, we've helped over 3 million mothers in 60+ countries on their breastfeeding journeys. We know every mom needs something different:\nexclusively pumping moms need power, working moms need discretion, and new moms need comfort\n.\n\nThis\n\nMomcozy breast pump comparison guide\n\nwalks through our full lineup, which now spans five families: the\n\nW Series\n\n(warm-massage wearable),\n\nAir Series\n\n(ultra-slim wearable),\n\nM Series\n\n(smart wearables),\n\nS Series\n\n(classic wearables), and the\n\nV Series\n\n(hospital-grade pumps). The family now includes the new warm-massage\n\nW1\n\nand the hospital-grade\n\nV3\n\n(plug-in) and\n\nV3 Pro\n\n(cordless) — so whether you need a discreet pump for the office or strong suction at home, this Momcozy pump comparison has you covered.\n\nHow Many Breast Pump Models Does Momcozy Have?\n\nTo make choosing easier, we've organized our pumps into distinct families. Each series has a different design philosophy, but all are built to give you freedom, comfort, and the ability to \"get back to feeling like yourself\".\n\nThe W Series (W1)\n:\n\nOur comfort-forward family, launched with the W1 — the industry's first warm-massage wearable breast pump. Gentle heat and rhythmic massage work with suction to encourage let-down and comfort.\n\nThe Air 1 Series\n: Our newest model, designed to be the slimmest and most discreet pump on the market.\n\nThe M Series (M5, M6, M9)\n: These are our all-in-one comfort models, focusing on ergonomic design, gentle suction, and a \"painless\" pumping experience.\n\nThe S Series (S9 Pro, S12 Pro Quick)\n: Our classic and beloved wearable pumps. These are the reliable workhorses of our collection, known for their efficiency and long battery life.\n\nThe V Series (V1 Pro, V2 Pro, V3, V3 Pro)\n: Momcozy V series breast pumps have tubing to connect motor and milk collector.\n\nThe family now adds the plug-in hospital-grade\n\nV3\n\nand the cordless\n\nV3 Pro\n\n— both with Dual-Pump Dual-Control and five built-in rhythms.\n\nLet's dive into a detailed Momcozy breast pump models comparison.\n\nMomcozy W Series Breast Pumps\n\nThe W Series is Momcozy's comfort-forward wearable family. It launches with the\n\nW1\n, the industry's first warm-massage wearable breast pump — built for moms who want gentle warmth and soft rhythmic massage working alongside suction to encourage let-down and comfort.\n\nMomcozy W Series — At a Glance\n\nModel\n\nPrice\n\nCore Feature\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nBest For\n\nW1\n\n$329.99\n\nWarm-Massage Sync (HugWave™ + SoftPulse™)\n\n295 mmHg (12 lv / 15×3)\n\nWarm-Massage Sync, Massage, Expression, Mixed + Milk Boost/Milk Relief; app\n\nLow supply, comfort seekers, warm-compress lovers\n\nMomcozy W1 — Warm-Massage Wearable Breast Pump\n\nThe\n\nMomcozy W1\n\n(model BP420) is a hands-free wearable pump with industry-first Warm-Massage Sync technology. Exclusive\n\nHugWave™\n\nwave rhythm and\n\nSoftPulse™\n\nmassage deliver 3 levels of warmth (38–40°C) and 3 levels of rhythmic massage that sync with the pumping cycle. It reaches up to\n\n295 mmHg\n\nacross 12 levels (or 15 levels × 3 speeds in pro mode), holds\n\n180 ml\n, weighs\n\n280 g\n, and runs about\n\n10 sessions per charge\n\n(6 with warmth on). All settings — warmth, massage, mode, and milk tracking — live in the Momcozy app.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe W1 is an all-in-one in-bra unit about 2.8\" thick, with food-grade BPA-free silicone cups and a 24 mm flange plus 17/19/21 mm inserts for a snug fit. The 180 ml collector means fewer interruptions, and Type-C charging takes about 2.5 hours.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nFive modes cover the day: Warm-Massage Sync, Massage, Expression, Mixed, plus Milk Boost and Milk Relief. Suction tops out at 295 mmHg with 12 levels (or 15 × 3 speeds), and the motor stays under 50 dB. The app lets you fine-tune warmth and massage without breaking your rhythm.\n\nWhat is Momcozy W1 best suitable for?\n\nThe W1 is ideal for moms with low or sluggish supply who benefit from warmth and massage, moms with sensitive or engorged breasts who want a gentler let-down, and anyone who wants app-controlled comfort during every wearable session. It pairs especially well with a hospital-grade pump at home for moms who need both comfort on the go and power at the nightstand.\n\nMomcozy Air Series Breast Pumps\n\nMomcozy Air Series — At a Glance\n\nModel\n\nPrice\n\nCore Feature\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nBest For\n\nAir 1\n\n$369.99\n\nUltra-slim, in-bra discreet\n\nQuiet smart motor (<45 dB)\n\nApp control, wireless charging case (up to 15 sessions)\n\nWorking moms, travel, ultimate discretion\n\nMomcozy Air 1\n\nThe\nMomcozy Air 1\nwas crafted for one primary purpose: ultimate discretion. It is the thinnest, most premium wearable pump we've ever designed, made for the mom who needs to pump absolutely anywhere without a second thought. It's the pump that is truly \"in-bra, under the radar\".\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe slim profile of the Air 1 is its defining feature, allowing it to be worn under clothing almost invisibly. But its design is about more than just aesthetics. We integrated a transparent top-view window, which solves one of the biggest challenges of\nwearable pumps\n: nipple alignment. You can look down and ensure perfect placement every time, optimizing efficiency and preventing discomfort.\n\nThe flanges are made from an incredibly soft 50A silicone, designed to gently conform to all breast shapes and sizes for a secure, comfortable, and leak-free fit.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe Air 1 is as smart as it is sleek. It features an ultra-quiet motor that operates at less than 45dB, so you can pump confidently in a silent room or on a work call. It integrates fully with the Momcozy app, allowing you to switch modes, track sessions in real-time, and even get notifications when the collector is full.\n\nPerhaps its most convenient feature is the wireless charging case. This case doesn't just store your pumps; it charges them. A single charge of the case can provide up to 15 pumping sessions or 5 days of use, effectively eliminating cord clutter from your daily routine.\n\nWhat is Momcozy Air 1 best suitable for?\n\nThe Air 1 is the ideal choice for the busy, modern mom who prioritizes discretion. This is for the executive pumping in an open-plan office, the mom running errands, or the parent who wants to pump on a plane or at a social event without anyone knowing. It is our premium, high-tech, \"invisible\" solution.\n\nMomcozy Air 1 Ultra-slim Breast Pump\n\n$314.99 USD\n\n$369.99 USD\n\nUltra-slim\n\nWireless Charging\n\nEffortless Alignment\n\nSmart App Control\n\nMomcozy Wellness 1 Warm-Massage Wearable Breast Pump\n\nFrom\n$329.99 USD\n\nWarm-Massage\n\nMilk Boost Mode\n\nReliable Battery\n\nTransparent Top\n\nMomcozy M Series Breast Pumps\n\nThe M Series is our \"All-in-One Comfort\" line. These pumps (\nM9\n,\nM6\n, and\nM5 Smart\n) are designed to be as simple and gentle as possible. They are all-in-one units, meaning the motor and milk collector are a single, compact piece that fits in your bra, with no external motors, tubes, or wires.\n\nMomcozy M Series — At a Glance\n\nModel\n\nPrice\n\nCore Feature\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nBest For\n\nM9\n\n$269.99\n\nSmart app (Mobile Flow™)\n\nup to -300 mmHg\n\n15 levels, 2 pro modes (Milk Relief™, Milk Boost™) + 3 standard, app\n\nData-driven moms, supply tracking\n\nM6\n\n$229.99\n\nSimple all-in-one (Mobile Style™)\n\n-285 to -300 mmHg\n\n3 modes, 9 levels, no app\n\nSimplicity, all-day wear\n\nM5 Smart\n\n$199.99\n\nGentle baby-mouth (horizontal)\n\nEfficient (whisper <50 dB)\n\n3 modes (upgraded Mixed), 9 levels, app\n\nSensitive nipples, lightweight\n\nMomcozy M9\n\nThe Momcozy M9, or Mobile Flow™, is the \"smart\" pump designed for data-driven moms. Its defining feature is advanced app integration that puts complete control and tracking at your fingertips.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe M9 features a sleek all-in-one design—motor and collector integrated into a single unit that fits discreetly in your bra with no wires or tubes. The transparent Tritan collector is durable, highly transparent, and resistant to over 100 boiling cycles, while DoubleFit™ soft silicone flanges (24mm with 17mm/19mm/21mm inserts) ensure a secure, comfortable seal. The 150ml capacity supports longer sessions without frequent emptying.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe M9 delivers hospital-grade suction up to -300mmHg with a 3rd-gen motor operating whisper-quiet at under 42dB. Through the app, access 15 suction levels, personalized preferences, plus 2 professional modes (Milk Relief™ and Milk Boost™) and 3 standard modes. The app automatically tracks duration, output, and production trends, with alerts when sessions complete. A 12-minute quick charge provides power for one full pumping session.\n\nWhat is Momcozy M9 best suitable for?\n\nIdeal for tech-savvy moms who want optimization through data, working moms needing smart tracking and reminders, moms building supply who want to monitor trends, and anyone who prefers app-based control over manual settings.\n\nMomcozy Mobile Flow™ Hands-Free Breast Pump | M9\n\nFrom\n$159.99 USD\n\nHigh Efficiency\n\nExpert-Tuned Rhythms\n\nAPP Control\n\nLong Battery\n\nM9 Bra Bundle: M9 Breast Pump and YN46 Nursing Bra\n\n$309.98 USD\n\nMomcozy M6\n\nThe Momcozy M6, or Mobile Style™, balances ergonomic comfort, sleek design, and straightforward simplicity. It's built for moms who want reliable, efficient pumping without complicated features—just stylish functionality that works.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe M6's streamlined, ergonomic design stays nearly invisible under clothing, tested on over 1,000 moms to ensure discreet, comfortable all-day wear. The all-in-one construction integrates motor and collector into a lightweight unit (10.12 oz) that won't weigh you down. Soft silicone flanges adapt to your breast shape for a secure seal, while the 6.09 oz capacity handles generous output. With only 4 accessories to wash, cleanup is remarkably simple.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe M6 features a 2nd-generation motor delivering powerful suction from -285 to -300mmHg with 3 modes (Stimulation, Expression, Mixed) and 9 adjustable levels. The optimized pumping rhythm—perfected through feedback from 1,100+ moms—balances gentle suction with natural frequency for comfortable, effective sessions. Simple button controls make adjustments effortless, with no app required. The 180-minute battery provides 5-6 sessions per charge, supporting full-day freedom.\n\nWhat is Momcozy M6 best suitable for?\n\nPerfect for moms who value simplicity and ease of use, appreciate stylish ergonomic design, want straightforward controls without app connectivity, and need comfortable all-day wearability. Ideal for busy schedules requiring a \"just works\" solution.\n\nMomcozy Mobile Style™ Hands-free Slim Breast Pump | M6\n\nFrom\n$129.99 USD\n\nMore Milk\n\nMore Discreet\n\nPowerful Suction\n\nComfort\n\nMomcozy M5 Smart\n\nThe Momcozy M5 Smart is our upgraded flagship comfort pump, combining our famous \"baby-mouth\" suction with new smart technology. It features a unique horizontal pumping angle that mimics a baby's natural latch, offering a gentle and pain-free experience that you can now control entirely from your phone.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe M5 Smart uses a horizontal angle inspired by how babies naturally nurse, which helps reduce discomfort and increases milk flow. Weighing only 8 ounces, it is 1/3 lighter than most pumps and fits invisibly inside your bra with no wires or tubes. The soft silicone flanges (24mm with 17mm/19mm/21mm inserts) adapt comfortably to your shape, and the collector holds a generous 120ml+ of milk.\n\nUpdate\n\nBest-seller M5 is now\nM5 Smart\n!\n\nConnect to the\nMomcozy App\nto track volume and control sessions from your phone.\n\n✓ Smart Tracking\n\n✓ App Control\n\nShop Now\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe M5 Smart features 3 modes, including an upgraded Mixed Mode that stimulates and expresses at the same time for a faster letdown. You can choose from 9 adjustable suction levels, all while the pump stays whisper-quiet (under 50dB). The biggest upgrade is the Momcozy App connectivity, allowing you to track milk volume and control your settings from your smartphone. The battery lasts for 6-7 sessions (100-120 minutes) and includes a 30-minute auto shut-off for safety.\n\nWhat is Momcozy M5 Smart best suitable for?\n\nThe M5 Smart is perfect for tech-savvy moms who want to track their breastfeeding journey, moms with sensitive nipples who need a gentle touch, and anyone wanting a lightweight, truly hands-free solution that's easy to use anywhere.\n\nM5 Smart Bra Bundle: Double M5 Smart Breast Pump and Nursing Bra(YN21)\n\n$229.98 USD\n\nNew Mom Kit\n\nHands-Free Feed\n\nBudget-Friendly Combo\n\nEasy Pumping\n\nMomcozy V Series Breast Pumps\n\nThe V Series features a unique separated-motor design with tubing to connect the motor and milk collector. The defining characteristic of this series is its design: the motor is a separate, portable unit that connects to the in-bra collection cups via slim, discreet tubing.\n\nWhy this design? It's a breakthrough in physics. By moving the heavy motor off the breast, the in-bra collection cups become incredibly lightweight and comfortable. It also allows us to use a much larger, more powerful motor for superior performance.\n\nMomcozy V Series — At a Glance\n\nModel\n\nPrice\n\nCore Feature\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nBest For\n\nV1 Pro\n\n$199.99\n\nHospital-grade, separated-motor\n\nup to -300 mmHg\n\n3 rhythms, 15 levels\n\nEP moms, building supply\n\nV2 Pro\n\n$199.99\n\nPortable, separated-motor\n\n288 mmHg\n\n3 modes, 9 levels\n\nWork, power on the go\n\nV3\n\n$249.99\n\nPlug-in hospital-grade, Dual-Pump\n\n-270 mmHg\n\n5 built-in rhythms, 15 levels, app\n\nAt-home supply building, exclusive pumpers\n\nV3 Pro\n\n$299.99\n\nCordless hospital-grade, smart\n\n-270 mmHg + StableFlow™\n\n5 rhythms + adaptive suction, app\n\nAt-home + portable, smart reliability\n\nMomcozy V1 Pro - Hospital grade suction breast pump\n\nThe\nMomcozy V1 Pro\nis our powerhouse and only true hospital-grade pump. Its breakthrough separated-motor design delivers maximum suction power for moms who need serious efficiency to establish or maintain full milk supply.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nThe V1 Pro's revolutionary design separates the motor from the collection system—a portable motor unit connects to lightweight in-bra cups via slim, flexible tubing. This separation is transformative: removing the heavy motor makes the cups incredibly comfortable for extended wear while allowing for a larger, more powerful motor. The DoubleFit™ soft silicone flanges (24mm with 17mm/19mm/21mm inserts) ensure proper fit, while integrated collectors prevent milk backflow for hygienic collection.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe V1 Pro delivers genuine hospital-grade suction up to -300mmHg—the same power found in clinical pumps. The 3rd-generation motor offers 3 fine-tuned rhythms that mimic baby's suckling patterns at different hunger levels, plus 15 adjustable suction levels for complete customization. The 2300mAh battery supports up to 9 sessions per charge, ensuring reliable performance throughout your day without constant recharging.\n\nWhat is Momcozy V1 Pro best suitable for?\n\nIdeal for exclusively pumping (EP) moms, moms of twins or multiples needing maximum efficiency, moms building or increasing supply through power pumping, and anyone requiring hospital-grade performance with mobility freedom.\n\nOverview\n\nV1 Pro Hospital-Strength Wearable Breast Pump\n\n$169.99 USD\n\n$199.99 USD\n\nHospital-strength\n\n-300mmHg Suction\n\n15 Suction Levels\n\n3rd-Gen Motor\n\nV2 Pro Hospital-Strength Wearable Breast Pump - Ultra-light & Potent\n\n$169.99 USD\n\n$199.99 USD\n\nHospital-strength\n\nMore Comfort\n\nWhisper-quiet\n\nPortable\n\nMomcozy V2 Pro - Portable breast pump\n\nThe Momcozy V2 Pro features the same innovative separated-motor design as the V1 Pro, optimized for ultimate portability. It delivers powerful, efficient suction in a whisper-quiet, ultra-compact package designed for busy, on-the-go moms.\n\nDesign, Flange, and Milk Collector\n\nLike the V1 Pro, the V2 Pro uses a separated-motor design with a lightweight, pocket-sized motor unit connecting to in-bra collection cups via slim tubing. The motor is exceptionally compact and portable, easily slipping into purses or pockets. The lightweight cups remain comfortable under clothing for discreet pumping anywhere. DoubleFit™ soft silicone flanges (24mm with 17mm/19mm/21mm inserts) provide secure, leak-free seals, while integrated collectors ensure hygienic milk collection.\n\nMotor, Suction, Modes, and Pumping Settings\n\nThe V2 Pro delivers strong suction up to -288mmHg—powerful enough for efficient milk expression while operating at whisper-quiet levels under 48dB. It offers 3 pumping modes (including milk supply building and stimulation) and 9 adjustable suction levels, giving ample customization for comfort and efficiency. The ultra-quiet operation makes it perfect for pumping in shared spaces, during meetings, or while traveling without drawing attention.\n\nWhat is Momcozy V2 Pro best suitable for?\n\nPerfect for working moms returning to the office needing efficient pumping during breaks, moms frequently on-the-go requiring portable power, moms valuing discretion in shared spaces, and anyone wanting strong performance in a lighter, quieter package than traditional hospital-grade pumps.\n\nMomcozy V3 — Plug-In Hospital-Grade Breast Pump\n\nThe\n\nMomcozy V3\n\nis a plug-in hospital-grade pump built for serious supply work at home. Its Dual-Pump Dual-Control design runs two independent channels so each breast gets its own setting, and\n\nSoftStart™\n\nramps suction up gradually to protect sensitive nipples. It reaches about\n\n-270 mmHg\n\nand ships with five built-in rhythms — Cozy Flow, Power Pumping, Milk Boost, Lactation Starter, and Deep Emptying — all adjustable across 15 levels in the app. A closed system and roughly 4 hours of battery backup keep sessions uninterrupted, and optional wearable cups add hands-free freedom.\n\nWhat is Momcozy V3 best suitable for?\n\nThe V3 suits exclusively pumping moms, moms of multiples, and anyone building or rebuilding supply who wants consistent hospital-grade power at home. It is the \"big host\" anchor of a two-pump setup: pair it with a wearable like the Air 1 or W1 for life outside the house.\n\nMomcozy V3 Pro — Cordless Hospital-Grade Breast Pump\n\nThe\n\nMomcozy V3 Pro\n\nkeeps everything moms love about the V3 and cuts the cord. It is a\n\ncordless, rechargeable\n\nhospital-grade pump with the same Dual-Pump Dual-Control power and five built-in rhythms, plus\n\nStableFlow™ smart pressure stabilization\n\nand adaptive suction that hold consistent vacuum as the milk flows. A brightness-adaptive night light and a premium waterproof carrying bag make it ready for bedroom sessions and travel alike.\n\nWhat is Momcozy V3 Pro best suitable for?\n\nThe V3 Pro is for moms who want hospital-grade performance without being tied to a wall — perfect as the at-home \"big host\" that also travels. Like the V3, it pairs naturally with a wearable pump for daytime outings.\n\nMomcozy S Series Breast Pumps\n\nThe S Series is our \"Classic Wearable\" family. These are the beloved, reliable pumps that made Momcozy a top-selling brand in North America. In this design, the motor sits directly on top of the milk collector, creating a simple, compact, and highly effective wearable unit. They are celebrated for their powerful suction, ease of use, and fantastic value.\n\nMomcozy S Series — At a Glance\n\nModel\n\nPrice\n\nCore Feature\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nBest For\n\nS12 Pro Quick\n\n$139.99\n\nLED screen, 210 ml collector, 3-step clean\n\n295 mmHg\n\nMassage / Expression / Mixed, 9 levels\n\nBest-value reliable workhorse\n\nS9 Pro\n\n$119.99\n\nLong battery life\n\n285 mmHg\n\n2 modes, 9 levels\n\nBusy moms, travel, backup\n\nMomcozy S12 Pro Quick\n\nThe Momcozy S12 Pro Quick is the high-efficiency model of the S series. It features a clear, smart LED screen that allows you to easily see your mode, suction level, and battery life at a glance. With 3 modes and 9 suction levels, it offers a highly customizable and efficient pumping session, making it a favorite for moms who want to \"set it and forget it\" with confidence.\n\nWhat is Momcozy S12 Pro Quick best suitable for?\n\nIdeal for moms who want a reliable, customizable workhorse pump with clear visual feedback, moms seeking strong suction and efficiency at an excellent value, and those who prefer straightforward controls with LED display over app connectivity.\n\nThe\n\nS12 Pro Quick\n\n(model BP360) is our upgraded classic wearable. It keeps the clear LED screen and 9 levels you liked, and adds a larger\n\n210 ml\n\ncollector, a\n\n≤46 dB\n\nquiet motor, a\n\nMixed mode\n\n(stimulation + expression together), a memory function, and a DoubleFit™ hybrid flange for a better seal — all at the same $139.99 double-pump price.\n\nMomcozy S9 Pro\n\nThe Momcozy S9 Pro is the workhorse of the S series, and its defining characteristic is its upgraded, long-lasting battery life. It's designed to give you more pumping sessions on a single charge than ever before. This makes it the perfect \"go-bag\" pump, a reliable backup, or the primary choice for a busy mom who doesn't have time to be tethered to a charger.\n\nWhat is Momcozy S9 Pro best suitable for?\n\nPerfect for busy moms who need extended battery life without frequent charging, moms wanting a reliable backup or travel pump, and anyone seeking a dependable, no-fuss wearable pump at the best value in our collection.\n\nMomcozy Breast Pump Models Comparison\n\nThis table breaks down the core features of each pump to help you compare them at a glance.\n\nModel\n\nPrice (USD)\n\nCore Feature (USP)\n\nMotor Location\n\nSuction\n\nModes & Levels\n\nKey Specs\n\nBest Suitable For\n\nW1\n\n$329.99\n\nWarm-Massage Sync (industry-first)\n\nAll-in-one (in-bra)\n\n295 mmHg\n\nWarm-Massage Sync, Massage, Expression, Mixed + Milk Boost/Milk Relief\n\n180 ml, 280 g, ~10 sessions, app\n\nLow supply, comfort, warm-compress lovers\n\nAir 1\n\n$369.99\n\nUltra-slim & discreet, app-controlled, wireless charging case\n\nAll-in-one (in-bra)\n\nSmart App Control\n\nApp-controlled\n\n2.4\" thick, Wireless charging case (5 days use), <45dB, App sync\n\nThe working mom; moms needing ultimate discretion\n\nM9\n\n$269.99\n\nSmart app control for tracking & customization\n\nAll-in-one (in-bra)\n\nHigh Efficiency\n\nMultiple Modes (App)\n\nApp for settings, milk tr