ssed during each session to keep track of your progress and maintain a detailed log.\n\nOverflow Alert:\nGet vibration alerts and app notifications when your bottle is almost full to help prevent spills and keep your pumping mess-free.\n\nComfort Meets Innovation\n\nCrafted with food-grade soft and firm silicone, the DoubleFit™ Flange offers a smooth, skin-like feel, enhancing comfort while reducing irritation during every pumping session.\n\nSecure and Invisible\n\nDesigned with real mums in mind, the drop-shaped form naturally fits your bra, providing a comfy, secure fit that won't bulge or sag.\n\nTested in over 1,000 trials to ensure a comfortable fit for a wide range of chest shapes, helping you pump confidently and discreetly – even at work.\n\nThe DoubleFit™ Flange is made from food-grade silicone, and is FDA- and LFGB-certified for safe milk contact.\n\nThe PPSU funnel tunnel can withstand temperatures from 135°C to 179°C and endure multiple boiling cycles without deformation.\n\nThe Tritan milk bowl is durable, highly transparent, and resistant to over 100 boiling cycles.\n\nEffortless Extraction\n\nEffortless Extraction\n\nWorks in Sync With You\n\nThe PowerFlow™ system features an upgraded 3rd-generation motor, delivering -300mmHg suction with 15 finely tuned levels – helping you find the most comfortable and efficient rhythm at every stage.\n\n3rd-Gen Motor\n\nOur latest technology\n\noffers superior performance\n\n-300mmHg Suction\n\nEnsures efficient\n\nmilk extraction\n\nQuiet and Discreet\n\nAt just 42dB, Mobile Flow™ is the quietest* wearable pump in the -300mmHg suction class. Whether you're in a meeting, on your commute, or at your desk, you can express discreetly without drawing attention.\n\n*Tested for noise levels in -300mmHg suction mode compared to other wearable pumps that reach -300mmHg suction strength. (Internal testing, 2024).\n\nReady in Minutes, Even If You're Not\n\nWhen the battery is fully drained, just 12 minutes of charging with a 5V/2A adapter* gives you enough power for one full pumping cycle –perfect for those moments when you're on the go and have forgotten to charge.\n\n*Power adapter is not included in the package.\n\nStore Safe and Clean\n\nThe separate Tritan milk bowl allows you to pump and store – with no need to clean anything – allowing you to spend more time on what matters.\n\nDiscover the Momcozy App\n\nStep1\n\nDownload the Momcozy App.\n\nTip: The App is compatible with iOS 13 + and Android 10+.\n\nStep2\n\nRegister your account.\n\nTip: Tip: Log in with your Momcozy account.\n\nStep3\n\nTurn on the Bluetooth and the breast pump. Then, add the device through the '+' and 'Devices' buttons on the app.\n\nFAQs\n\nIs Momcozy M9 hospital-grade breast pump?\n\nMomcozy M9 is a wearable, personal breast pump with\nhospital-grade suction power\n. It is helpful to know the distinction between a \"hospital-grade\" pump and \"hospital-grade suction.\"\n\nA \"hospital-grade\" breast pump is a multi-use, rental pump designed for use in a hospital or clinical settings. They are made in a closed system so the milk won't get into the motor or tubing, so they can be shared with many mothers safely. They are most commonly for mums who need to establish their milk supply or mums with a baby in the NICU.\n\nOn the other hand, \"hospital-grade suction power\" refers to the suction power and cycle rate of the pump. This is used to refer to a pump that can produce sufficient suction to initiate and maintain a milk supply by mimicking a powerful suckling baby.\n\nBrief and to the point, the Momcozy M9 delivers powerful performance in a convenient, hands-free configuration that's perfect for personal, in-your-home or on-the-go applications. Unless you have a medical need for a multi-user pump, a personal pump with hospital-grade suction like the M9 should be ample power for your daily pumping needs.\n\nWhat is the suction level of the Momcozy M9?\n\nThe Momcozy M9 offers a powerful\nmaximum suction 