umping.\n\nComfortable fit\n\nMade with soft and skin-friendly silicone, the DoubleFit™ flange attaches snugly to your breasts without causing discomfort.\n\nIncreases milk production\n\nEndorsed by Momcozy's user testing research, the DoubleFit™ flange can potentially increase milk production by 28.2%.\n\n102-Degree Angled Tunnel\n\nEnables moms to lean back comfortably during pumping sessions.\n\nDouble-Electric & Hands-Free Pump\n\nEmpowers moms to multitask and attend to other matters while pumping.\n\nCustom-Fit Inserts for Every Mum\n\nThe breast pump includes a 24mm funnel and 17mm, 19mm, and 21mm inserts to ensure a proper fit and maximise milk volume. If these sizes don't work for you, you can try other available sizes or buy additional inserts for a better fit.\n\nTo ensure the best fit and comfort, please follow our\nmeasuring guide\nto find your flange size.\n\nHygienic Milk Collection\n\nPreventing milk backflow or leakage ensures cleanliness during pumping, keeping the milk free from\ngerms and contaminants. This is important for babies, as hygienic milk collection means safe nutrition.\n\nIntegrated Milk Collection Cup\n\nImproves sealing performance and prevents milk backflow, ensuring a clean and hygienic milk collection process.\n\nLeak-proof Seal on the Milk Outlet\n\nMinimises leakage or contamination during use.\n\nOnly 3 Milk-Contact Parts\n\nSimply Cleaning Process, Save Your Time for Baby Caring\n\nDoubleFit™ Flange\n\nMilk Collector\n\nValve\n\nAdvanced Features and Lasting Power for Convenient Use\n\nStreamline Your Journey\n\nUpgraded Main Unit\n\nMaximizes convenience with advanced settings and detailed information for optimal pumping sessions.\n\n2300mAh Large Capacity Battery\n\nSupports up to 8 sessions on a single full charge, eliminating the need for frequent charging.\n\nWhat's in the Box\n\nPump Motor * 1\n\nMilk Collector * 2\n\nTubing * 2\n\nFlange Cover * 2\n\nFlange Insert (17mm) * 2\n\nFlange Insert (19mm) * 2\n\nFlange Insert (21mm) * 2\n\nDouble-sealed Flange (24mm) * 2\n\nUSB Type-C Cable * 1\n\nQuick Start Guide * 1\n\nValve * 4\n\nNipple Ruler * 1\n\nUser Manual * 1\n\nFAQs\n\nIs V1 Pro a wearable breast pump?\n\nYes — in the UK sense. Wearable usually means the cups sit in your bra so you can move around. V1 Pro does that with a separate motor unit and in-bra collection cups, on a short tube. It is not an all-in-one, tube-free wearable like M5 Smart or Air 1.\n\nWhat is a hospital-strength electric breast pump with in-bra cups?\n\nIt is an electric breast pump where the motor stays off your chest and the cups go in your bra. Hands-free here means you are not holding the flanges — it is not the same as a tube-free cup. V1 Pro is that format: 15 suction levels and up to −300 mmHg, for UK mums who want a stronger motor at home. We do not call it hospital-grade.\n\nIs V1 Pro a good electric breast pump for home?\n\nYes. Choose V1 Pro when you want longer sessions at home with the motor off your chest, 15 levels, and cups that still sit in the bra. It is a strong\nelectric breast pump\nif emptying well matters more than having no tubes. If you want everything in the bra and no tubing, start with M5 Smart.\n\nWhat is the difference between V1 Pro and V2 Pro?\n\nSame type: separate unit, in-bra cups, tubing. V1 Pro has more levels (15) and suction up to −300 mmHg, with a 240 g motor — the home, more-control pick. V2 Pro is the lighter unit: 127 g motor, nine levels, up to −288 mmHg. Pick V1 Pro for finer control; pick V2 Pro if you want the motor easier to carry.\n\nShould I get V1 Pro or an all-in-one like M5 Smart?\n\nIf you want the whole pump in your bra with no tubes, choose M5 Smart (or Air 1 / M9). If you would rather keep a stronger motor off your chest and still have in-bra cups, choose V1 Pro. Hands-free is true of both; the split is where the motor sits.\n\nHow do I use V1 Pro?\n\nAssemble each cup: flange, collector and valve. Keep the motor dry.\n\nSeat the cups in a pumping bra. Use the inserts so the nipple sits centred in the tunnel.\n\nClip or pocket the motor and connect the tubes. Choose a rhythm and a suction level that feels comfortable — not the highest.\n\nWhen you finish, switch off, disconnect the tubes, then pour.\n\nWhat flange size do I need?\n\nMeasure nipple diameter, not bra cup. V1 Pro includes a 24 mm DoubleFit flange and 17/19/21 mm inserts. Pain, a white ring, or too much areola being pulled in means resize before you turn suction up. Fit empties the breast better than chasing a higher number.\n\nHow do I clean and sterilise V1 Pro?\n\nWipe the motor dry only — never soak it or the tubing ends on the motor. Wash the three milk-contact parts per cup (flange, collector, valve) in warm soapy water, then sterilise with steam or a cold-water method. Air-dry fully. Follow current NHS guidance when you store expressed milk.\n\n4.8\n\nRated 4.8 out of 5 stars\n\nBased on 414 reviews\n\n5\n\nRated out of 5 stars\n\n331\n\n4\n\nRated out of 5 stars\n\n71\n\n3\n\nRated out of 5 stars\n\n10\n\n2\n\nRated out of 5 stars\n\n1\n\n1\n\nRated out of 5 stars\n\n1\n\n97%\n\nwould recommend this product\n\nSlide 1 selected\n\nReviews\n414\n\n(tab expanded)\n\nQuestions\n\n(tab collapsed)\n\nFilters\n\nWrite a Review\n(Opens in a new window)\n\n414 reviews\n\nSort\n\nMost Recent\n\nOldest\n\nMost Helpful\n\nPhotos & Videos\n\nHighest Rating\n\nLowest Rating\n\nLeast Helpful\n\nT\n\ntonka\n\nVerified Buyer\n\nReviewing\n\nV1 Pro Hospital-Strength Wearable Breast Pump\n\nI recommend this product\n\nRated 5 out of 5 stars\n\n5 days ago\n\nQuiet, Comfortable and Convenient\n\nI'm very familiar with the momcozy brand and have previously used several models of their breast pumps so I was very keen to try the V1 Pro and see how it compared to others. My first impression was that it felt like a really well made pump and it comes nicely presented in the box.You get two pumps which is ideal as you can use both at the same time. I found the initi