 nag-stand out.<br/>[1:26] Meron siyang specific features para sa mga mommies na makapagbigay ng comfort at different kind of pumping experience.<br/>[1:35] At dahil katatapos lang natin mag-pump, mano-notice mo talaga kaagad yung full surface warmth.<br/>[1:39] So, sa buong breast mo, hindi lang sa one area.<br/>[1:41] Meron din siyang 5-zone suction sync massage na nagke-create ng rhythmic feeling kaya mare-relax ka talaga habang nagpapa-pump.<br/>[1:48] So, yung combination ng warmth and then itong massage, grabe yung combination nila, especially kapag feeling mo full na full ka na, uncomfortable ka, iba yung experience na mapi-feel mo.<br/>[2:01] At kahit po comfort focus siya, I can still fit it into my business workday.<br/>[2:05] Nagustuhan ko rin po yung smart app control dahil pwede nating i-adjust yung pumping settings directly from my phone, which is especially convenient kapag po busy tayo.<br/>[2:13] After naman po natin mag-pump, yung one-press assembly at yung only five parts to clean make the cleanup pretty straightforward.<br/>[2:20] Para sa mommies na kagaya natin na ginagawa 'to multiple times a day, maa-appreciate talaga natin yung little convenience.<br/>[2:28] So, na-try na po natin pareho, pero depende po talaga sa inyo kung ano yung pinaka-kailangan niyo.<br/>[2:32] Kung gusto niyo po yung classic, all-in-one, busy kayo, itong M5.<br/>[2:36] Pero kung gusto niyo naman po yung comfort, yun yung priority niyo, ito pong Wellness 1 yung option at yung mare-recommend ko.<br/>[2:42] Lalo na po yung combination ng full surface warmth at yung 5-zone suction sync massage.<br/>[2:46] Kaya naman mga mommies, hindi ito about kung ano ba yung better, kundi kung ano yung best para sa'yo, kung ano yung kailangan mo at kung ano yung magwo-work sa routine mo.<br/>[2:54] So, mga mamas, kayo po ba ay team smart convenience or team comfort?<br/>[2:58] Paki-comment po sa baba.<br/>[2:59] Thank you.<br/>[3:00] Bye.</td><td>[00:00] 等等，各位妈妈，你们以为这款吸奶器只有加热功能特别吗？<br/>[