{"advice": null, "anchor": "#l.1-0", "anchors": null, "channel": null, "char_count": 11012, "heading_path": "材料收集", "kb_type": "internal_sample", "material_type": null, "media_refs": null, "meta": {"field_name": "材料收集", "kind": "paragraph"}, "order_in_parent": 1, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "polarity": null, "reason_analysis": null, "reason_category": null, "resource_id": "wiki__TqJSduQE3oBM4uxtHhmcrVtGnPg", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1730", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "sample_body": null, "source_sha256": "eafccd58327e3b060930a9dfb8678d902434c3b052cb65b5c15827bfa129043d", "splitter_version": "l2-0.3", "text": "<title>Momcozy 横测 - tseringla5 - Script V3待审核</title>\n达人id：tseringla5\n达人link：[https://www.tiktok.com/@tseringla5](https://www.tiktok.com/@tseringla5)\n产品：Momcozy Wellness 1\n权益：\n- 1 TikTok video published through TTO Link\n- 90-day Secondary Usage Rights (Re-post & Re-edit)\n- 90-day TikTok ad code + link in bio\nScript V3 待审核\n<table><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><b>Script</b></td><td><b>Translation</b></td><td><b>钛动反馈</b></td><td><b>客户反馈</b></td></tr><tr><td><b>Scene 1 - Hook: Show the milk collected, then remove the Momcozy pump</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “I just finished pumping this much with the Momcozy Wellness 1, so let's compare it with my Eufy S2 Pro.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> Momcozy Wellness 1 vs Eufy S2 Pro<br/><b>Scene 2 - Hold both pumps side by side</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “Both have heat and massage, but the Momcozy Wellness 1 provides warmth across a larger area, which feels more soothing and comfortable to me.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> Larger full-surface heating area<br/><b>Scene 3 - Close-up of the Momcozy heating and massage areas working</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “Its 5-zone massage synchronizes with the suction, so the pumping rhythm feels softer and more natural.\nFor me, having the warmth and massage work together with the suction makes the whole session feel more relaxing and helps me get into letdown more easily.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> Full-surface warmth + 5-zone massage<br/><b>Visual reminder:</b> Please also include close-ups of the flange and the five massage zones <b>when they are not working</b>, so the structure and design of both features are clearly visible.<br/><b>Scene 4 - Show both pumps while comparing the experience</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “The Eufy has more customization options, but when I’m pumping multiple times a day, I really notice how the Momcozy brings the heat, massage, and suction together.\nIt feels more comfortable and natural for me throughout the session.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> Heat + massage + suction<br/><b>Scene 5 - Show the app and pump controls, then compare the collectors</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “Both offer app control, and I also like that the Momcozy Wellness 1 has a larger 6-ounce capacity compared with 5 ounces on the Eufy, so I have a little more room during each session.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> 6 oz vs 5 oz<br/><b>Scene 6 - Take the Momcozy apart and show the five washable parts</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “Cleanup is also easier — just press to release, and there are only five washable parts.\nThat makes it really quick for me to take apart, clean, and get back to my day.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> One-Press Release + 5 washable parts<br/><b>Scene 7 - Show both pumps, then put the Momcozy back on</b><br/><b>VO:</b> “The Eufy is a solid option too, but when I look at the overall experience and how it performs for me, I feel like the Momcozy Wellness 1 is a better fit for what I need right now — especially with the wider warmth, synchronized massage, and easier cleanup.”<br/><b>On-screen text:</b> My comfort pick: Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td><b>Scene 1 - Hook：展示吸出的奶量，然后取下Momcozy吸奶器</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “我刚用Momcozy Wellness 1吸完这么多奶，所以今天想拿它和我的Eufy S2 Pro对比一下。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> Momcozy Wellness 1 vs Eufy S2 Pro<br/><b>Scene 2 - 手持两款吸奶器并排展示</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “两款都有热敷和按摩，但Momcozy Wellness 1的加热覆盖范围更大，对我来说，这种温热感会更舒缓、更舒服。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> Larger full-surface heating area<br/><b>Scene 3 - 特写Momcozy加热和按摩区域工作状态</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “它的5区按摩会和吸力同步，所以整个吸奶节奏感觉更柔和、更自然。对我来说，热敷和按摩能够跟吸力配合起来，会让整个吸奶过程更放松，也让我更容易进入奶阵。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> Full-surface warmth + 5-zone massage<br/><b>画面提醒：</b> 除了工作状态的特写，也请补充拍摄<b>非工作状态下的法兰以及5个按摩区域特写</b>，让这两个功能的结构和设计也能清楚展示出来。<br/><b>Scene 4 - 两款吸奶器同时展示，对比实际使用体验</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “Eufy有更多自定义选项，但如果一天需要吸好几次，我会更明显地感受到Momcozy把热敷、按摩和吸力结合在一起。对我来说，整个过程会感觉更舒服、更自然。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> Heat + massage + suction<br/><b>Scene 5 - 展示App和吸奶器控制，然后对比奶碗容量</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “两款都有App控制，而且我也很喜欢Momcozy Wellness 1有更大的6盎司容量，相比Eufy的5盎司，每次吸奶的时候都能多一些空间。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> 6 oz vs 5 oz<br/><b>Scene 6 - 拆开Momcozy并展示5个可清洗零件</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “清洗起来也更简单——按一下就可以拆卸，而且只有5个需要清洗的零件。对我来说，这样就能很快拆开、洗干净，然后继续忙自己的事情。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> One-Press Release + 5 washable parts<br/><b>Scene 7 - 展示两款吸奶器，然后重新佩戴Momcozy</b><br/><b>口播：</b> “Eufy也是一款不错的选择，但综合考虑整体使用体验和实际表现，我还是觉得Momcozy Wellness 1更适合现在的我——尤其是更大范围的温热、同步按摩，以及更方便的清洗体验。”<br/><b>屏幕文字：</b> My comfort pick: Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td><ol><li seq=\"1\">协同因果已增强</li><li>横评维度已增加</li><li>体验已增加</li><li>Softpulse已替换成容量的卖点</li><li>结尾已修改</li></ol></td><td>推进拍摄，请跟红人强调多个人体验融入。</td></tr></tbody></table>\nScript V2 待审核\n<table><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><b>Script</b></td><td><b>Translation</b></td><td><b>钛动反馈</b></td><td><b>客户反馈</b></td></tr><tr><td>Scene 1 - Hook: Show the milk collected, then remove the Momcozy pump <br/>VO: \"I just finished pumping this much with the Momcozy Wellness 1, so let's compare it with my Eufy S2 Pro.\" <br/>On-screen text: Momcozy Wellness 1 vs Eufy S2 Pro <br/>Scene 2 - Hold both pumps side by side <br/>VO: \"Both have heat and massage, but the Momcozy Wellness 1 provides warmth across a larger area, which feels more soothing and comfortable to me.\" <br/>On-screen text: Larger full-surface heating area <br/>Scene 3 - Close-up of the Momcozy heating and massage areas working <br/>VO: \"Its 5-zone massage synchronizes with the suction, so the pumping rhythm feels softer and more natural.\" <br/>On-screen text: Full-surface warmth + 5-zone massage <br/>Scene 4 - Show both pumps while comparing the experience <br/>VO: \"The Eufy is very customizable, but I prefer how the Momcozy combines heat, massage, and suction.\nIt helps me relax and makes letdown feel easier.\" <br/>On-screen text: Heat + massage + suction <br/>Scene 5 - Show the app and pump controls <br/>VO: \"Both offer app control, while the Momcozy also has SoftPulse micro-pulses and suction up to 295 mmHg.\" <br/>On-screen text: App control + SoftPulse micro-pulses <br/>Scene 6 - Take the Momcozy apart and show the five washable parts <br/>VO: \"Cleanup is also easier - just press to release, and there are only five washable parts.\" <br/>On-screen text: Press release + 5 washable parts <br/>Scene 7 - Show both pumps, then put the Momcozy back on <br/>VO: \"Overall, I still like my Eufy for customization, but for wider warmth, synchronized massage, and easier cleanup, the Momcozy Wellness 1 wins on comfort for me.\" <br/>On-screen text: My comfort pick: Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td>场景1 - 开场钩子：展示收集到的母乳，然后取下Momcozy吸乳器<br/>VO：“我刚用Momcozy Wellness 1吸了这么多奶，现在来和我的Eufy S2 Pro对比一下。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：Momcozy Wellness 1 对比 Eufy S2 Pro<br/>场景2 - 将两个泵并排摆放<br/>VO：“两款都有热敷和按摩功能，但Momcozy Wellness 1的热敷覆盖面积更大，我用着觉得更舒缓舒服。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：更大的全表面加热面积<br/>场景3：Momcozy 加热与按摩区域工作状态特写<br/>VO：“它的5区按摩功能可与吸力同步，因此泵动节奏会更柔和、更自然。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：全幅恒温 + 5区按摩<br/>场景4 — 对比体验时同时展示两台泵<br/>VO：“Eufy这款产品的自定义程度很高，但我更喜欢Momcozy将热敷、按摩与吸乳功能相结合的设计。它能帮我放松，让喷乳反射来得更顺畅。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：热敷+按摩+负压吸引<br/>场景5 - 展示应用程序及泵控装置<br/>VO：“两款都支持应用程序控制，而Momcozy款还具备SoftPulse微脉冲功能，吸力最高可达295 mmHg。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：应用控制 + SoftPulse 微脉冲<br/>场景6 - 将Momcozy拆开，展示五个可水洗部件<br/>VO：“清洁起来也更方便——只需按压即可拆卸，而且只有五个可水洗部件。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：新闻稿 + 5个可水洗部件<br/>场景7 — 展示两款吸乳器，然后重新戴上Momcozy<br/>VO：“总体而言，我还是喜欢自己这款Eufy，因为它支持自定义设置，但要说更全面的保暖效果、同步按摩功能以及更易清洁的特性，Momcozy Wellness 1在舒适度方面更合我心意。”<br/>屏幕文字：我的安心之选：Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td><ol><li seq=\"1\">已补充W1的加热面积更大，带来的感受也更舒适，按摩功能gentle，</li><li>需补充加热按摩协同起来比单独的加热更多舒适、更早letdown</li><li>已补充Easy Cleanup</li><li>加热区域和按摩区域的工作状态已特写，注意需要提醒达人非工作状态的法兰和五个阵子特写也需要展示</li><li>已并排对比</li></ol></td><td>关于script建议：<ol><li seq=\"1\">有 “combines” + “helps me relax and makes letdown feel easier”，但协同因果仍不够强。</li><li>但横评维度仍偏少，主要还是在讲Wellness1。</li><li>有部分体验描述，但整体仍是卖点罗列 one by one，体验分析不足。</li><li>其余请IMC复核。</li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table>\nScript V1 待审核\n<table><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><b>Script</b></td><td><b>Translation</b></td><td><b>钛动反馈</b></td><td><b>客户反馈</b></td></tr><tr><td>Momcozy Wellness 1 vs Eufy S2 Pro <br/>Short-form video script - hook starts with removing the pump from your chest <br/>Scene 1 - Hook: taking the pump out of your bra/chest <br/>VO: \"Okay...\nI just finished pumping with this, and I need to show you how it compares to my eufy S2 Pro.\" <br/>On-screen text: Momcozy Wellness 1 vs Eufy S2 Pro <br/>Scene 2 - Hold both pumps side by side <br/>VO: \"Both are wearable pumps with heat and massage, but the experience feels pretty different.\" <br/>Scene 3 - Show Momcozy Wellness 1 close-up <br/>VO: \"The Wellness 1 uses full-surface warmth plus a 5-zone massage that syncs with the suction.\" <br/>On-screen text: Full-surface warmth + 5-zone massage <br/>Scene 4 - Show app / controls / pump in hand <br/>VO: \"It also has SoftPulse micro-pulses, app control, and suction up to 295 mmHg.\" <br/>Scene 5 - Show flange and cup <br/>VO: \"The DoubleFit flange feels really soft, and the cup holds up to 6 ounces.\" <br/>On-screen text: DoubleFit flange - 6 oz cup <br/>Scene 6 - Show eufy S2 Pro briefly <br/>VO: \"I still like my eufy S2 Pro because it is also really customizable, but Momcozy's comfort system feels more focused on combining warmth, massage, and suction together.\" <br/>Scene 7 - Lifestyle shot / putting Momcozy back on or holding it <br/>VO: \"So if comfort is one of the biggest things you care about when pumping, this is definitely an interesting wearable to look at.\" On-screen text: Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td>Momcozy Wellness 1 对比 Eufy S2 Pro<br/>短视频脚本——开场钩子从把吸乳护罩从胸前取下开始<br/>场景1 - 钩子动作：将Wellness 1 泵从内衣/胸口处取出<br/>VO：“好的……我刚用这个完成了吸奶，得给你看看它和我的Eufy S2 Pro 对比起来怎么样。”<br/>屏幕文字：Momcozy Wellness 1 对比 Eufy S2 Pro<br/>场景2 - 将两个泵并排摆放<br/>VO：“这两款都是带热敷和按摩功能的穿戴式按摩仪，但使用体验却大不相同。”<br/>场景3 - 特写展示Momcozy Wellness 1<br/>VO：“Wellness 1 采用全表面加热设计，搭配可与吸力同步的 5 区按摩功能。”<br/>屏幕显示文字：全域恒温 + 5区按摩<br/>场景4 - 手持展示应用/控制界面/泵体<br/>VO：“它还具备SoftPulse微脉冲功能、应用程序控制功能，吸力最高可达295毫米汞柱。”<br/>场景5 - 展示法兰与杯体<br/>VO：“DoubleFit 法兰触感非常柔软，杯体容量可达 6 盎司。”<br/>屏幕显示文本：DoubleFit 法兰盘 - 6 盎司杯<br/>场景6 — 短暂展示 eufy S2 Pro<br/>VO：“我仍然喜欢我的 eufy S2 Pro，因为它的自定义程度也很高，但 Momcozy 的舒适系统在将热敷、按摩与吸乳功能相结合方面做得更有针对性。”<br/>场景7 - 生活方式实拍 / 重新佩戴Momcozy产品或手持该产品<br/>VO：“所以如果吸奶时你最在意的点之一就是舒适度，那这款穿戴式吸奶器绝对值得关注。” 屏幕文字：Momcozy Wellness 1</td><td><ol><li seq=\"1\">达人强调了Momcozy Wellness 1 热敷、按摩与吸乳功能融为一体的协同系统，主要突出热敷的同时可以进行按摩</li><li>场景3可以补充W1的加热面积更大，带来的感受也更舒适，按摩功能gentle，因此协同作用起来比单独的加热更多舒适、更早letdown</li></ol></td><td>关于红人script建议：<ol><li seq=\"1\">强化 Full-Surface Warmth 的差异化：场景3建议明确说明 Wellness 1 的加热覆盖面积更大，并结合达人实际感受，例如“更全面的温热感，让整个吸奶过程更舒适”。</li><li>补充 Massage 的实际体验：明确加入 gentle massage，不要只说“5-zone massage”。可以描述为按摩随吸力同步、触感更柔和自然，让用户理解“舒服在哪里”。</li><li>加强协同作用的因果：建议把“heat + massage + suction”从功能罗列升级为体验结论，例如：温热 + 同步按摩同时配合吸力，让整个过程感觉更自然、更舒适，也能帮助更快进入 letdown。</li><li>画面要验证卖点：场景3建议用特写直接展示加热区域和按摩区域的工作状态，让“Full-Surface Warmth”和“5-Zone Massage”有直观视觉支撑。</li><li>补充 Easy Cleanup：目前缺少 One-Press Release + 5 washable parts，建议增加一个简短清洁镜头，完善 Key Message 覆盖。</li><li>横评感需要加强：目前 Eufy 只在开头和场景6简单出现，整体仍偏“介绍 Wellness 1”。建议增加明确的 Wellness 1 vs.\nEufy 对比维度，让用户更容易理解为什么在“comfort”这一需求下选择 Wellness 1。</li></ol></td></tr></tbody></table>", "unit_id": "8f71ec4248d0fcc908ed", "unit_type": "sample"}
