it for every body type. This expanded sizing option makes the M9 particularly suitable for mothers who require larger flange sizes.\nThe Air 1 boasts a larger milk collection capacity at 6 ounces (180ml) compared to the M9's 150ml capacity. This additional capacity can be particularly beneficial during longer pumping sessions or for mothers with higher milk output, reducing the need for mid-session interruptions.\nBoth models feature a flat-base milk collector design for stability. A key practical difference is that the M9 includes a lid for its milk collector, allowing you to store breast milk directly in the collector after pumping—perfect for quick storage between sessions. The Air 1 la", "unit_id": "ee256d46264908ebdf12", "unit_type": "clause"}
