rything in between.\nFor M6 , you control everything with physical buttons—no Bluetooth, no syncing, no app issues. It's ideal for moms who prefer simplicity or caregivers who just want to press and go.\nWith built-in app connectivity, the M9 syncs to your smartphone. Through the Momcozy app, you can:\nAdjust suction and modes without touching the pump\nTrack pumping sessions, milk output, and side history\nCustomize patterns for better comfort and results\nWith the smart features, It can help moms monitor pumping patterns, keep track of milk output, and ensure balanced use of both breasts.\nPerfect for multitasking moms—no need to touch the pump during meetings, baby naps, or nursing sessions. The app keeps everything organized and hands-free.\nOverall Design: Form, Function, and Everyday Usability\nAt a glance, the Momcozy M6 and M9 look similar. Both feature a sleek teardrop shape, come in two color options, and include a flat base that allows you to set them down without tipping over. But dig a little deeper, and their design philosophies start to diverge.\n5 core parts (Flange, Milk Collector, Valve, Silicone Diaphragm, Motor ) + USB-C cable + flange cover\nThe M6 and M9 consists of just five core components—flange, milk collector, valve, silicone diaphragm, and motor—making them easy to assemble, clean, and reassemble even when you're exhausted or in a hurry. Their streamlined design also means fewer points of failure and less risk of suction issues due to poor part alignment. Also, they features two elegant color: Cozy Red and Quill Grey.\nNotably, the M9 is slightly more compact than M6, making it a bit easier to fit into smaller nursing bags or conceal under clothing.\nFlange Design: Comfort Starts with Fit\nA properly fitting flange can make a huge difference in your pumping experience. For both M6 and M9, each model is equipped with the Momcozy DoubleFit™ flange, a cushioned breast shield that creates a snug, secure seal during use.\nThe flange on both M6 and M9 uses a dual-material design. The part that touches your breast is made of soft silicone to stay gentle on the skin and reduce discomfort. Meanwhile, the section that guides the milk is made from firmer plastic. This helps prevent leakage and keeps the suction stable during pumping. The combination ensures both comfort and performance in every session.\nBoth pumps feature a 105° flange angle, which mimics the natural curve of the breast. This ergonomic design reduces pressure on sensitive areas, making longer sessions more comfortable.\nThree flange inserts in 17mm, 19mm, and 21mm sizes for smaller nipple fits\nAn optional 27mm flange (sold separately) for moms with larger nipple", "unit_id": "6fd2088f6741960335f5", "unit_type": "clause"}
