rts earlier let-down for a faster, smoother start.\nHelps milk move through ducts for\nFeels gentler while still delivering up to 295 mmHg of suction.\n28.2% higher pumping efficiency and 10% fewer leaks.*\nWhy Warmth & Massage Make a Difference\n\"WHO notes that higher milk volumes have been associated with warming the breast before pumping, as well as with massage and relaxation techniques. \"— Katie Clark, International Board-Certified Lactation Consultant\n~70% Reported Earlier Let-Down*\nWarmth + Gentle Massage help the body relax, supporting the natural release of oxytocin—the hormone that triggers milk let-down .\n*Based on quantitative findings from internal real-user testing. Results are self-reported. Individual results may vary.\nResearch shows warm", "unit_id": "6c3aedb110bf8b06004d", "unit_type": "clause"}
{"anchor": "#l.1-2", "char_count": 4000, "heading_path": null, "kb_type": "wording", "meta": {"anchor_precision": "segment_only", "content_quality_flag": "recrawl_headless_rendered", "content_quality_note": "2026-09-29 统一口径无头渲染正文"}, "order_in_parent": 2, "pair_ref": null, "parent_unit_id": null, "resource_id": "url__https____momcozy.com_collections_wearable-breast-pump_products_momcozy-wellness-1-warm-massage-wearable-breast-pump-w1", "rule_eligible": true, "rule_eligible_run": "20260924-1730", "rule_eligible_source": "not_material_collection", "source_sha256": "08d106b29eef850a726c461e817bf2450a9906d697f233c01cd1db7ce0824e7c", "splitter_version": "l2-0.3", "splitter_version_backfilled_at": null, "text": "th and massage together achieved the highest observed milk volume compared with pumping alone.*\n*Source: Mollaahmetoglu SE & Guvenc G., Breastfeeding Medicine, 2025. RCT of 120 NICU mothers.\nExpert-Engineered Safety in Every Detail\nThermal safety requires a margin below the 43°C burn-risk threshold. To account for natural temperature fluctuations, Momcozy thoughtfully caps Wellness 1 at 106°F (41°C).\nExpert-Guided Protection, Built In\nProlonged warmth may increase the risk of skin discomfort and low-temperature burns, so built-in time limits help keep use gentle and controlled.\n— Lactation Experts & Momcozy Medical Team\nFDA 510(k) Cleared. Made with Care.\nWellness 1 is FDA 510(k) Cleared and made with BPA-free milk-contact materials and upgraded, softer silicone for greater peace of mind and gentle comfort against the skin.\nReliable Power, Up to 10 Sessions per Charge\nEven with Warmth & Massage, enjoy up to 6 sessions—no charging case needed.\nStay in the Flow with Momcozy App\nAdjust, personalize, and track your pumping at your fingertips.\nAdjust Settings From Your Phone\nChange suction, warmth, and massage without interrupting your session.\nLog your output and review past sessions.\nProfessionally tuned pumping rhythms—ready to start with a single tap.\nSave your preferred settings for next time.\nEvery Detail, Thoughtfully Designed\nWhat is the Momcozy Wellness 1 warm-massage breast pump and why do the warmth and massage features help with milk flow?\nThe Momcozy Wellness 1 (Momcozy W1) is a warm-massage breast pump. It is the first wearable pump to use our industry-first rhythmic massage and wraparound warmth. This combined approach is key:\n1. The gentle heat relaxes your breast tissue and milk ducts, just like a warm compress.\n2. The rhythmic massage breast pump uses soothing vibrations to mimic a baby’s natural touch. This helps your body release oxytocin—the hormone needed for milk let-down—making the milk flow smoother and faster.\nHow does the heating feature on the Momcozy W1 work, and is it a safe heated breast pump?\nThe Momcozy W1 has an industry-first wraparound warmth design. This heat feature works like a built-in warm compress on the flange area. It gives wide, gentle, comforting warmth that helps your breast relax and respond naturally. The temperatures are very carefully controlled to be safe.\nWhat is the difference between the Momcozy W1 and the Air 1?\nThe Momcozy Wellness 1 represents a significant shift from the Air 1. The major improvement in the W1 is the inclusion of the industry-first integrated heat and advanced rhythmic vibration massage pump technology, which the Air 1 lacks. In contrast to the Air 1, which features app connectivity and a charging case, the Momcozy W1 focuses purely on wearable comfort, warmth, and massage and app enabled but doesn't include charging case. The core benefit of the Momcozy W1 is the therapeutic warm-massage breast pump experience.\nHow does the Momcozy W1 compare to a standard pump?\nThe Momcozy W1 is both a powerful wearable pump and a heated breast pump. Standard pumps only use suction. The Momcozy W1 adds our rhythmic massage and wraparound warmth. People call it the ultimate warm-massage breast pump because the heat and massage relax your body for better milk expression.\nHas the Momcozy Wellness 1 been tested for safety and does it have certifications?\nYes, absolutely! We tested the motor and all parts of the Momcozy Wellness 1 very carefully. Experts checked them to make sure they are safe, strong, and will last a long time. Rest assured that this warm-massage breast pump complies with all relevant safety standards and certifications, making it a reliable tool for your entire feeding journey.\nDoes the pump come with accessories or spare parts?\nYes, the Momcozy W1 includes all essential parts you need to start pumping right immediately. We also include different inserts for the flanges to meet various sizing needs, ensuring you get the perfect fit for your warm breast pump. ", "unit_id": "217cf675af76a038a53e", "unit_type": "clause"}
