have enough power for both day and night use without needing to carry a bulky extra charging case.\nIs there a carrying or travel bag included?\nW1 does not include a dedicated carrying or travel bag by default.\nIts compact design makes it easy to store in most personal bags, backpacks, or baby bags.\nHear from Real Moms Before You Buy\n90% would recommend this product\nReviews 70 (tab expanded) Questions 12 (tab collapsed)\nWrite a Review (Opens in a new window)\nSort Most Recent Oldest Most Helpful Photos & Videos Highest Rating Lowest Rating Least Helpful\nMy Momcozy W1 is by far my favorite pump, it empties me as well as my wall pump but is completely hands free not to mention super comfortable! As an exclusively pumping mom it’s super important that I’m able effectively and efficiently fully empty myself every pump and the W1 does that! I have another pump that has similar features but this one is my favorite. It’s completely customizable both on the pump itself but also in the app so if you decide you don’t want heat or vibration you can turn it off. It also has a few pre programmed pump sessions that change modes between stimulation and expression so you don’t have to worry about going back and forth. I love this pump, and highly recommend!\nRead More Read more about this review\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from Fiona A. was helpful. 0 people voted yes No, this review from Fiona A. was not helpful. 0 people voted no\nI’ve had this for over a month now and can say this pump is easily the best one on the market. It used to take me over 40 minutes of pumping to be fully empty, but with the heating and vibration features of the Wellness 1 pump it now takes me less than 30 minutes. I also love that I can look down and actively see my milk output, and one charge last a long time. These are worth every penny!\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from Caprisha R. was helpful. 4 people voted yes No, this review from Caprisha R. was not helpful. 2 people voted no\nBest investment ever, I mean I wouldnt pay $400 for it but I caught it on a sale and Im so glad I got it! I didnt know pumping didnt have to be torture. The temperature added heat makes it soothing, now the massage is just a vibration but it still helps as well.I had the M5 before which wasnt bad as well but I def havent used it since this one arrived.\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from Andrew was helpful. 2 people voted yes No, this review from Andrew was not helpful. 0 people voted no\nWhy d. y. k. c. t. r. d. o. a. o. a.\nSo much in love with this,travel and work convenient too\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from Why d. y. k. c. t. r. d. o. a. o. a. was helpful. 0 people voted yes No, this review from Why d. y. k. c", "unit_id": "618959dd4b55236edec9", "unit_type": "clause"}
