t getting a decent let down and then a steady flow. It is excellent quality. I am very impressed with it.A full five stars.\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from Reviewer was helpful. 0 people voted yes No, this review from Reviewer was not helpful. 0 people voted no\nI bought this for my daughter and she loves it. Plenty of room for milk and it is very quiet. She also loves that there are only 3 parts! The pump is not on each cup like some pumps making it much lighter and more comfortable to wear. She has had other wearable pumps before and says this one is way better and she loves it.\nWas this helpful? Yes, this review from jmblue was helpful. 0 people voted yes No, this revie", "unit_id": "cf40241bd5fd8679c7f8", "unit_type": "clause"}
